# Density Compare
# Americium (Am) — real density 12 g/cm³. equal masses: Americium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Americium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.7mm color: #00ff80 at (-20mm, 4.4mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 95.7 g — the water cube is the reference
